# Web-Manage / face kiosk

## Kiosk

- Route: `/company/timestamp-face` → `enroll-face` standalone component
- Fullscreen chrome: `html.dpu-kiosk-mode` (set by `content-layout` + component) hides header/sidebar/footer — CSS in `assets/css/dpu-theme.css`
- Multi-person: IoU tracks, smooth boxes, per-`memberId` cooldown
- Prefer **WebSocket** `/face/ws/kiosk` for identify + walk-by check-in; HTTP fallback if WS down
- Crop faces before send; do not upload full frames for multi-person
- Cap concurrent check-ins / identifies; never global-lock the whole camera for one person
- Do not change face WS / GPU / check-in logic when only polishing kiosk layout
- WS session payload comes from `enroll-face/kiosk-ws-client.ts` (`buildKioskSession`) and includes the JWT; punch photos use `authedImage()` (`?token=`)

## Auth / routing

- `AuthGuard` on the content layout; `RoleGuard` with `data.area` (`admin` | `company`) on `common.module.ts` / `company-management.module.ts`
- `HttpRequestInterceptor` is the only HTTP stack (`provideHttpClient(withInterceptorsFromDi())`); it refreshes on **401/403** via `/auth/refresh-token` and must not log URLs
- Login saves `access_token` + `refresh_token`; `mustChangePassword` → `/auth/change-password`
- Header badge reads `GET /notifications/pending-count`; no hard-coded counts
- Company audit + notification settings page: `/company/audit-log`

## Shared list UI kit

Prefer these over inventing new list chrome:

| Piece | Path |
|-------|------|
| Toolbar | `shared/components/page-toolbar/` |
| Search | `shared/components/pill-search/` |
| Stat chip | `shared/components/stat-chip/` |
| Pager | `shared/components/simple-pager/` |
| Empty/loading | `shared/components/empty-state/` |
| Map | `shared/components/location-map/` (OSM fallback) |
| List CSS | `shared/styles/dpu-list-page.css` |
| Brand tokens | `assets/css/dpu-theme.css` (`--dpu-brand` teal `#0f766e`) |

Patterns: `app-page-header` + toolbar (title/chips/search/actions) + table or cards + modal CRUD; client-side filter then paginate; `ng-select` with `[appendTo]="'body'"`; labeled buttons without `ti-btn-sm`.

## Shell (header / sidebar / content)

- Layout: `shared/layouts/content-layout/` — keep `<app-switcher class="dpu-hidden-switcher">` mounted
- Header/sidebar: declutter only; preserve Ynex `data-toggled` / `data-nav-layout` behavior
- Menus: `shared/services/nav.service.ts` — `getCommonMenu()` (admin) vs `getCompanyMenu()` (company)
- Theme lock: `html.dpu-theme-lock` hides dark toggle + theme switcher UI

## Angular habits

- Standalone components where the feature already is standalone
- Use `NgZone` + `ChangeDetectorRef` when updating UI from `setInterval` / WS / face-api
- Production `environment.prod.ts` uses `baseUrl: ''` (same-origin via nginx)
- Rebuild `admin` image after UI changes: `docker compose ... up -d --build admin`
- Removed and must stay out: `shared/prismData`, Firebase / `@angular/fire`, `react`, `gsap`, `ng-gallery`, `ngx-editor`; import `Validators` from `@angular/forms`
- Budget: initial warn 2 MB / error 8 MB (`angular.json`) — trim before adding a new chart/map library

## UI

- Keep kiosk overlay readable (name + confidence on box); avoid cluttering the first camera viewport
- Toast + feed panel for results; soft-fail walk-by misses (toast, retry track) instead of spamming error feed
- Thai UI copy is OK for kiosk and admin screens; keep code/comments in English unless the file already uses Thai
